I'll flatten dp[i][j][l] to index i*(m+1)*(k+1) + j*(k+1) + l.

Let me write this with loops. I'll iterate i from 1 to n, j from 1 to m, l from 1 to k, and compute each cell.

The table size is (n+1)*(m+1)*(k+1). I'll use a seq of that size, initialized to 0.

